{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","西尔维娜"],["/names/en","Silvina"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名能够禁止敌人释放技能的刺客，可以在战斗开始时瞬移至敌人身边发起快攻。"],["/description_i18n/en","An Assassin who can prevent enemies from casting skills, and teleport to their side instantly at the start of battle."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我在。下令吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Present. Your command?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","训练的理想结果。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Optimal training results."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","安静！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Silence."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","任务……失败……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","My quest... failed."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","下一个任务是？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","What is the next quest?"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我在。目标是谁？"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","I'm here. Who's the target?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","技术与准备，缺一不可。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Both techniques and tactics are indispensable."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","复杂而致命。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","A fatal strike."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","任务，还是任务对象？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","It's over in one thrust."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……你想要什么？下令吧。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","...What is your wish? Give your commands."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","感谢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Thank you."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","苍白处刑者"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","The Taken Breath"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","哪怕冷铁卷刃，依旧刀尖向前。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Even as the cold iron blade wears down, it still points forward, guiding the way."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","犹记少时"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Nostalgic Reverie"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","温暖又天真的童年，她似乎短暂地拥有过一瞬，又似乎从未拥有过。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Her childhood was a fleeting moment of warmth and innocence, almost as if it never really belonged to her."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Velvet Store"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……休息？什么意思"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Rest? What's that?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","去准备任务吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Let me get ready for my quest."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……好甜。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","So sweet..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……雪……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Snow..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节……吗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The Winter Carnival...?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里，太热闹了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This place is bustling with life."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","转瞬即逝的焰火……很美"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Fleeting sparks... such fragile beauty."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据说，西尔维娜只要一听到妹妹的名字，就算是在昏迷中也会马上惊醒。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","They say all it takes to bring Silvina back to her senses is the mere mention of her sister's name."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","西尔维娜曾经接受严酷的训练，那些比她强壮的同侪都纷纷倒下，但是她却在场上站到了最后。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Silvina underwent intense combat training in the past. While many of her peers were much stronger than her, she alone stood standing, until the very end."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","西尔维娜接受一切刺杀任务，除非对象是年轻的女性或小孩。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Silvina accepts any assassination request, so long as her target is not a young woman or a child."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","托安曾向西尔维娜许诺了金钱和地位，但被其拒绝。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Thoran once offered Silvina money and status, but she promptly refused."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","西尔维娜在危险的猎杀组织中没有任何头衔，完成的任务数量却比许多高层更靠前。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Silvina holds no titles or positions within her dangerous organization, despite completing more missions than many of her superiors."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说，西尔维娜生前就已经是一名刺客了。那时她才17岁。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","They say Silvina was also an assassin before she turned into a Graveborn. At the time, she was only seventeen years old."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","西尔维娜能够用高超的技巧耍刀，但她很少在人前这么做。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Silvina is incredibly proficient with blades but rarely displays her skills before others."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“她明明刚刚还在十步开外的地方，结果一转眼就到我背后了！”一位从西尔维娜手中逃出生天的年轻女性曾这样描述。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","\"She was clearly ten paces in front of me, but in the blink of an eye, she appeared at my back!\"—A man who managed to survive Silvina's attack."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","一般的小动物对西尔维娜十分惧怕，但不知为何，总有萤火虫会主动靠近她。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Most small creatures are terrified of Silvina, but for some reason, fireflies tend to gather around her willingly."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","据不可靠消息说，雇佣西尔维娜执行任务的价格并不昂贵。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Certain unreliable sources claim that Silvina's services are not particularly expensive."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","……休息？什么意思"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Rest? What's that?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415136.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415136.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Silvina"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","……好甜。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","So sweet..."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415137.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415137.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Silvina"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","……雪……"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Snow..."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415451.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415451.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Silvina"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节……吗"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","The Winter Carnival...?"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415452.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415452.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Silvina"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这里，太热闹了"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","This place is bustling with life."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415629.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415629.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Silvina"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","转瞬即逝的焰火……很美"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Fleeting sparks... such fragile beauty."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415630.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415630.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Silvina"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","来，伊莎贝拉，先喝杯热牛奶。"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Come, Isabella, have a glass of warm milk."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415667.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415667.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜 & 伊莎贝拉"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Silvina & Isabella"]]}